#
# tests/paperMode/Allrun
#
# PURPOSE
#
# Acceptance tests of milestone M4 of doc/phase-change-plan.md: the
# paper-mode carrier (utilities/setFrozenCarrier), the interaction layer
# 'distance' of interfaceExchange, and the code-to-code case run/014 of the
# temperature-based model of Lobresco et al. (2026) (plan section 6 M4,
# acceptance 1 to 6, the binding amendments listed in its focus, and the
# decisions of plan section 25).  Every numerical claim is checked on the
# written output by tests/paperMode/checks.py.
#
# Usage
#
#   tests/paperMode/Allrun          the criteria of 'tests/Alltest M4'
#                                   (about 25 min on at most 8 cores)
#   tests/paperMode/Allrun long     the code-to-code runs of acceptance 3 to
#                                   5 ('tests/Alltest M4long', hours on 16
#                                   cores; reused when nothing has changed;
#                                   tests/paperMode/longRuns, its variables
#                                   M4LONG_RUNS, M4LONG_JOBS, M4LONG_RANKS)
#
# Exit status: 0 when every criterion was tested (whatever the results),
# 1 when the script stopped early; Alltest reports that as a FAIL.
#
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
source "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/../functions"
requireOpenFOAM

